# NOTICE — rekt-oss-mma

`rekt-oss-mma` is the Docker image produced by `tools/cobol-rekt/Dockerfile`
and consumed by the `cobol-rekt` service in `docker-compose.yml`. It
packages the upstream **smojol COBOL toolkit** with a small set of local
leniency patches (see `./patches/` and `./patches/README.md`).

## Heartfelt thanks 🙏

This project would not exist without the remarkable work of
**Avishek Sen Gupta** and the contributors to:

> [**cobol-rekt** (`avishek-sen-gupta/cobol-rekt`)](https://github.com/avishek-sen-gupta/cobol-rekt) — smojol-cli, smojol-core, smojol-toolkit

Their COBOL parser, AST/CFG/Data extractor and Neo4j-friendly exports
are the foundation everything in `Azure-Samples/COBOL-Modernization-Agents`
builds on. The image distributed here is **strictly additive** — every
upstream behaviour is preserved unless a patch in `./patches/` explicitly
softens a hard failure for enterprise-scale corpora. We pin to upstream
tag **`v0.1.0-RC6`**.

We are very grateful for the public, permissive distribution of this work
and for the design choices that made layering on top of it tractable.

